/target
# Worktrees a fleet creates for parallel beads. `wt/` is the house location, so
# it is ignored here rather than in every developer's global config.
/wt

# Everything pact or an agent writes under .pact/ is local runtime state,
# EXCEPT the files below, which are history or graph and belong in git.
.pact/*
!.pact/events.jsonl
!.pact/messages.jsonl
!.pact/plan.json

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
*.gate.lock*

# The plan manifest handed to `pact plan lint` is a build artifact of one run
# (pact docs/plan.md); the linted snapshot that travels is .pact/plan.json.
plan.jsonl

# The plan manifest is a build artifact of one run — pact plan lint's own doc
# says not to commit it; the linted snapshot it writes to .pact/plan.json is
# runtime state and already ignored with the rest of .pact/. The bead graph
# itself travels in .beads-remote/.
/plan.jsonl
